  "title": "check_tfs.py: iterate through subdirs of epan/dissectors",
  "description": "Look for dissector files not only in epan/dissectors but also in\nsubdirectories.\n\nAt the moment, check_tfs.py --commits 500 processes\nepan/dissectors/asn1/gsm_map/packet-gsm_map-template.c. This file was\nchanged within the last 500 commits. However, running check_tfs.py\nwithout parameters does not process packet-gsm_map-template.c. We search\nfor dissectors only in epan/dissectors/.\n\nDescend into subdirectories of epan/dissectors to make the output\nconsistent.",
